WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:01,820
Blood Spirit Crossing

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,740
King Lao Zhu has eaten poisonous insects in the mountains all his life.

3
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:08,370
Poison can accumulate in the stomach, and so can medicine

4
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:13,980
Sneak him over

5
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:30,900
Breathe it in and your brother will live.

6
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,220
It's too far to save your life

7
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,380
Don't let him get dirty again
